                        "sense_id": "e889c004-c787-32bd-b55a-9bc9212eb650",
                        "entry_id": "c97d9349-878a-3bca-874c-5ee70e1fd01a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A hopeless visionary, a quixotic or unrealistic schemer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "426476c2-3261-4875-a564-bb73ed2e9fb3",
                                "sense_id": "e889c004-c787-32bd-b55a-9bc9212eb650",
                                "text": "Check thy self, thou Air-monger; that with a madding thought, thus chasest fleeting shadows."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfaba46a-1fde-4561-8184-a823cc60539e",
                                "sense_id": "e889c004-c787-32bd-b55a-9bc9212eb650",
                                "text": "Thus Men puff up themselves as big as Pride and Vanty can make them, with a conceit of their own Meritoriousness; tho it be a sordid thing for a man to be the Herald of his own Praise: But it may be said of these Airmongers as it is of the Cameleon, which is […] Nothing but Lungs […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "207ae364-3020-4c3e-b238-488eeca1bc00",
                                "sense_id": "e889c004-c787-32bd-b55a-9bc9212eb650",
                                "text": "At the same time, we would be no Marxists but philistines and air-mongers if we failed to take into consideration the other side of the question — the inevitability and exceptional importance for socialist construction of the material incentive of the masses with regard to the fruit of their work."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e3d37a3-ff52-40fa-8eba-52ef6a560464",
                                "sense_id": "e889c004-c787-32bd-b55a-9bc9212eb650",
                                "text": "It seemed that I was only an air-monger who built castles in the air. I failed! I lost! I was weak!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5be5ebe0-8cf4-48f8-a5a7-4b8a67116cb1",
                                "sense_id": "e889c004-c787-32bd-b55a-9bc9212eb650",
                                "text": "She would be muttering to the ewes—Where has that old airmonger gone now? What daydreams have taken him wandering?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
